sequenceDiagram
  actor Receptionist
  participant PA as Patient
  participant EN as Encounter
  participant ME as Medical Record
  participant BI as Billing
  actor Doctor
  actor Lab
  Receptionist->>PA: search / verify / create provisional patient
  PA-->>Receptionist: clinic-patient link
  Receptionist->>EN: POST walk-in visit (no appointment)
  EN->>EN: create visit, check-in, queue in local transaction
  EN-->>Receptionist: visitId, queueNumber
  Doctor->>EN: start assigned visit
  Doctor->>ME: write note / clinical order
  ME-->>Lab: assigned order available
  Lab->>ME: enter result
  Doctor->>ME: review result, diagnosis, prescription, sign
  ME->>ME: immutable version + release policy
  ME-->>BI: billable charge event via outbox
  Receptionist->>BI: collect onsite / issue receipt
  BI-->>Receptionist: confirmed collection
  Note over EN,BI: Clinical completion, bill paid and document release remain independent
